283 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Road accidents occurring during the past couple of years at an alarming rate particularly due to the two-wheelers index, therefore, reflects the demand for strong solutions to work. Saves lives through timely provision of medical services. Response to emergencies is delayed: causes heavy losses to patients involved in accidents. For this reason, we Design an automated accident detection system and response mechanism using Arduino. Uno, accelerometer, GSM module and GPS to get emergency response very quickly within case of accidents. The accelerometer sensor carries out the fundamental working of the system by continuously monitoring the tilt of the vehicle and even violent movements that might occur due to the accident. Every time such movement crosses the threshold limit, Arduino Uno verifies the sensor readings so that it ascertains that there is an accident indeed. Once it becomes active, the GSM module generates alert messages with all the important information. One of the main characteristics of the system is that it contains the GPS module. It captures the coordinates of the place of accident very accurately. The system sends those coordinates instantly over SMS to emergency contact numbers, neighboring medic facilities, and law enforcement organizations. This process allows to promptly understand the place of accident and therefore decreases the time intervals of the reaction and increases the chances of survival of accident victims. It is combined with a friendly application for Android to make the system accessible easily. The application forwards actual coordinates to emergency contacts, and how to get to that location is assisted by their mapping services. It also allows canceling false alerts within specified time, thus not dispensing unnecessary services. Conclusion: The proposed system thus offers an effective scalable framework for real-time accident detection with automatically generated notices of emergency using accessible affordable components. Such a system has the potential to cause considerable safety factors in roads as well as to minimize fatalities, as proper mediations would result from prompt responses. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
