501 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (In breast cancer detection, BIM plays a critical role in reconstructing high-contrast dielectric profiles of breast tissues. Tumors, being strong scatterers, challenge the Born approximation, but iterative refinements enable reasonably accurate reconstructions. The integration of machine learning further enhances this process, enabling precise localization and characterization of tumors, even in noisy environments. )
/E (In breast cancer detection, BIM plays a critical role in reconstructing high-contrast dielectric profiles of breast tissues. Tumors, being strong scatterers, challenge the Born approximation, but iterative refinements enable reasonably accurate reconstructions. The integration of machine learning further enhances this process, enabling precise localization and characterization of tumors, even in noisy environments. )
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
