503 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Real-world applications often involve noise in the measured data. BIM addresses this challenge through regularization techniques, such as Tikhonov regularization or total variation regularization. These methods suppress noise-induced artifacts, ensuring stable and accurate reconstructions. )
/E (Real-world applications often involve noise in the measured data. BIM addresses this challenge through regularization techniques, such as Tikhonov regularization or total variation regularization. These methods suppress noise-induced artifacts, ensuring stable and accurate reconstructions. )
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [4]
>>
