505 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (The computational cost of BIM is a critical factor, especially for large-scale problems. Advances in parallel computing and GPU acceleration have significantly reduced the runtime of BIM-based reconstructions. Hybrid approaches that combine BIM with CNNs also offer computational savings by leveraging pre-trained networks for faster convergence. )
/E (The computational cost of BIM is a critical factor, especially for large-scale problems. Advances in parallel computing and GPU acceleration have significantly reduced the runtime of BIM-based reconstructions. Hybrid approaches that combine BIM with CNNs also offer computational savings by leveraging pre-trained networks for faster convergence. )
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
