508 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Datasets like the UWCEM breast phantom repository are invaluable for validating BIM-based methods. These phantoms provide realistic models of breast tissues, enabling researchers to evaluate the performance of BIM under controlled conditions. Numerical results demonstrate that while BIM can achieve high accuracy, its performance improves significantly when combined with machine learning. )
/E (Datasets like the UWCEM breast phantom repository are invaluable for validating BIM-based methods. These phantoms provide realistic models of breast tissues, enabling researchers to evaluate the performance of BIM under controlled conditions. Numerical results demonstrate that while BIM can achieve high accuracy, its performance improves significantly when combined with machine learning. )
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
