/E (The project explores microwave imaging for breast cancer detection, emphasizing its non- invasive, non-ionizing benefits. Traditional methods like mammography often struggle with dense breast tissue and radiation risks. By integrating the Born Iterative Method \(BIM\) with advanced deep learning models \(U-Net and ResNet\), this approach aims to improve tumor segmentation, noise handling, and early detection, especially for small or subtle tumors. )
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [13]
>>
